## Client & organisation work

<sub>Systems I built for real clients and employers — a women's-health-tech community in China, an Auckland food festival, a Delaware startup, New Zealand's leading women-in-STEM charity, an independent Māori-led AI research commission, and a period-poverty startup — most still running today. I'm FemTech Weekend's CTO, GAVIGO's Founding Principal Engineer, and She Sharp's Senior Full Stack Engineer & Website Team Lead.</sub>

